			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 733560101,
					"content": "真令人不敢相信，我居然有一天能喝上你泡的茶。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560102,
					"content": "有那么稀奇吗？我不过是想感谢感谢你为「数秘阵列」提供的算力核心罢了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560103,
					"content": "另外，你干嘛老是说些好像很懂我们的话？看起来真的很自来熟欸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560104,
					"content": "说过了，我只是恰好很会看人而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560105,
					"content": "不过…哈，你说得对。我不该再自认为很了解你们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560106,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560107,
					"content": "光是从上次见面算起，你看起来就变了很多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560108,
					"content": "不然你还要从多久前算起？哼，我不过是接受了自己核心中的「错谬」，看清了一些事情而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560109,
					"content": "你呢？同为某种「人偶」的你，内心也会有什么时候出现解算的错谬吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560110,
					"content": "哈…何止是「错谬」呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560111,
					"content": "说来听听？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560112,
					"content": "我们还没熟到那种地步。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560113,
					"content": "哈，也对。我也就礼节性问问而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560114,
					"content": "不管怎么说，人偶在寻找「心」这件事上，恐怕都会绕不少弯子。至少我是这样。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560115,
					"content": "你似乎同创造了你的人关系不错？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560116,
					"content": "嗯，他给予了我很多帮助和指引，不论是生前还是死后。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560117,
					"content": "那这点上我就同你有根本性的区别。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560118,
					"content": "…哦。这样吗。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560119,
					"content": "抱歉，虽说在「人偶」这点上有些相似，但我也不该就此觉得理解了你什么。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560120,
					"content": "不，别在意。用你的说法，我也已经「接受」了曾经的「错谬」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560121,
					"content": "只不过我走的弯路有些太多了。弥补它需要走更长的路。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560122,
					"content": "那…加油？用你的说法，我也没和你熟到能给出更多建议。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560123,
					"content": "哈…彼此彼此吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				}
			]
		},
